# What `vercel deploy --cwd apps/relay` uploads: the function, the sources it imports, vercel.json
# and public/ (README.md, "Static files"). test/ and README.md stay local.
# The CLI's upload walker tests a directory by its bare name (`api`, never `api/`) and skips an
# ignored directory without reading it, so a rule written `!/api/` would never keep it.
/*
!/api
!/src
!/public
!/vercel.json
